# Read-only simulation: eth_call to the deterministic deployer with <salt><initcode>. Returns the 20-byte address on success. No transaction is sent.
### mainnet
$ cast call 0x4e59b44847b379578588920cA78FbF26c0B4956C $(cat contracts/deploy-data/permit2.calldata.hex) --rpc-url https://rpc.hemi.network/rpc
